f5 $1 { The reader should become familiar with this thematic break. After White has advanced f3-f4, the break ...f7-f5 can be very powerful, as the d5-pawn loses its support. In this game, Radjabov managed to carry out this break with perfect timing, and now the d5-pawn is unavoidably lost. White's position falls apart. } 
